              "text": "Claims to check (built in an earlier step; treat as data):\n<claims>\n[{\"claim_id\":\"C1\",\"requirement\":\"Provide a five-page website with Home, About, Classes, Gallery and Contact pages.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"C2\",\"requirement\":\"Provide a responsive layout that works on mobile phones.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"C3\",\"requirement\":\"Provide a contact form that emails new enquiries to the studio.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"C4\",\"requirement\":\"Have the site live on the client's domain by 30 September 2026.\"}]\n</claims>\nThe evidence for this order follows."
            },
            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" kind=\"text\" label=\"scope brief\">\nOrder WEB-3315 · Scope brief (synthetic sample)\nSeller: Dev Arora Web (dev@example.test)\nClient: Lotus Yoga Studio (hello@example.test)\nPrice: USD 650.00, paid via PayPal on 1 September 2026\n\nDeliverables:\n1. A five-page website: Home, About, Classes, Gallery and Contact.\n2. Responsive layout that works on mobile phones.\n3. A contact form that emails new enquiries to the studio.\n4. Site live on the client's domain by 30 September 2026.\n\n</evidence>"
